    {
      "id": "25598392",
      "title": "Adding a re-usable \"Card\" Component",
      "sourceHash": "6f756b2e77ae7c7a016cdcd3c5f87de1f3b2f2032670be859a8af90d9e1ff1b8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "So, let's build this card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 7.42,
          "en": "which I wanna have around my form together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.42,
          "end": 10.29,
          "en": "So here in add user, I want to be able to wrap this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.29,
          "end": 14.76,
          "en": "in a card component, which doesn't exist yet, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.76,
          "end": 19.28,
          "en": "and that should apply a nice styling here to this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.28,
          "end": 21.29,
          "en": "For data I would go to the UI folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.29,
          "end": 25.66,
          "en": "and in there at a card dot JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.66,
          "end": 26.493,
          "en": "Now in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.493,
          "end": 29.06,
          "en": "I'll create a pretty much standard React component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.06,
          "end": 31.36,
          "en": "so we import React from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.36,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "We then have card here, which gets props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 37.413,
          "en": "and we export this as our component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.53,
          "end": 41.97,
          "en": "Now the card component can be fairly trivial.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.97,
          "end": 44.46,
          "en": "I want to return a div let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 48.08,
          "en": "and inside of the div I wanna output to content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.08,
          "end": 50.98,
          "en": "which discards component is wrapped around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.98,
          "end": 54.31,
          "en": "So when I wrap card around my form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.31,
          "end": 57.71,
          "en": "this form should of course be output inside of the card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.71,
          "end": 60.62,
          "en": "So the card component here should output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.62,
          "end": 64.36,
          "en": "what's passed between the opening and closing tags off card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.36,
          "end": 66.97,
          "en": "And you'll learn that you can access this content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.97,
          "end": 71.97,
          "en": "on the special children prop, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.13,
          "end": 74.06,
          "en": "You put that between curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.06,
          "end": 77.53,
          "en": "because it's not JSX coded, it's a JavaScript expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.53,
          "end": 81.05,
          "en": "that should be evaluated inside of JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.05,
          "end": 83.44,
          "en": "And props children will give us that content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.44,
          "end": 85.56700000000001,
          "en": "which has passed between the opening and closing tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.56700000000001,
          "end": 87.293,
          "en": "of the card component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 90.6,
          "en": "Now, I will also assign a class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.6,
          "end": 92.06,
          "en": "so that we can style it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.06,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "and now I want to use CSS modules here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 97.68,
          "en": "You don't need to use that, you could use styled components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.68,
          "end": 100.69,
          "en": "you could use regular CSS classes and make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.69,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "that you don't repeat class names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 105.34,
          "en": "but I will use CSS modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.34,
          "end": 109.09,
          "en": "And therefore I'll add a card dot module dot CSS file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.09,
          "end": 111.333,
          "en": "where I can specify my card style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 115.39,
          "en": "I will add a card class in there, just like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.39,
          "end": 120.2,
          "en": "and normal CSS class, and give it a background of white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.2,
          "end": 122.42,
          "en": "Whoops, that should be background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.42,
          "end": 126.841,
          "en": "Give it a box shadow of zero two pixels, eight pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.841,
          "end": 130.72,
          "en": "rgba zero, zero, zero, 0.26,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.72,
          "end": 133.96,
          "en": "which will add a little bit of a drop shadow to the card,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.96,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "and the border radius of 10 pixels here for rounded corners.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.56,
          "end": 143.19,
          "en": "Now in card JS, we can import this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.19,
          "end": 147.36,
          "en": "Here we can import dot slash card dot module dot CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.36,
          "end": 149.84,
          "en": "And you'll learn that for a CSS modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.84,
          "end": 153.1,
          "en": "you now have to alter this import a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.1,
          "end": 157.11,
          "en": "This import would be right if you have a non module file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.11,
          "end": 159.3,
          "en": "if you use the regular CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.3,
          "end": 162.16,
          "en": "but if you wanna use that CSS modules feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.16,
          "end": 164.66,
          "en": "you have to import something, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.66,
          "end": 167.313,
          "en": "classes from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 171.04,
          "en": "And now you're on class name, we can assign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.04,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "one of the classes we have inside of the CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 176.63,
          "en": "In this case, we of course have only one class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.63,
          "end": 181.35,
          "en": "that's card class, so we can access classes dot card here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 184.91,
          "en": "And this will assign this generated unique class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.91,
          "end": 185.913,
          "en": "to that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.55,
          "end": 190.55,
          "en": "With that, the only step that is left",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.55,
          "end": 193.42,
          "en": "to have that finished card and to use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.42,
          "end": 195.6,
          "en": "is to go to the add user component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.6,
          "end": 198.88,
          "en": "where I wanna use that card, and import it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.88,
          "end": 202.25,
          "en": "Because you always need to import what you wanna use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.25,
          "end": 204.88,
          "en": "If you have a component in a different file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.88,
          "end": 208.31,
          "en": "and you wanna use it in this file, you have to import it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.31,
          "end": 211.24,
          "en": "from that other file, otherwise JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.24,
          "end": 213.31,
          "en": "and this React build process here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.31,
          "end": 216.53,
          "en": "can't make a connection between this file and the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.53,
          "end": 218.34300000000002,
          "en": "in which your component is to find.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.69,
          "end": 223.25,
          "en": "So here we can therefore import card from dot, dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.25,
          "end": 226.96,
          "en": "to go up one level, so to go out of the user's folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.96,
          "end": 230.47,
          "en": "into the components folder, and then into UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.47,
          "end": 233.81,
          "en": "and then to card and you omit the file extension here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.81,
          "end": 235.363,
          "en": "for JavaScript files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.48,
          "end": 238.84,
          "en": "With that we're importing card, and if we now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.84,
          "end": 243.31,
          "en": "it should compile fine, and this looks a little bit nicer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.31,
          "end": 247.52,
          "en": "but of course it's still not the final look I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.52,
          "end": 252.52,
          "en": "Now, to get that nicer look, attached you find a CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.73,
          "end": 257.23,
          "en": "to be precise, you find the add user dot module dot CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.23,
          "end": 259.27,
          "en": "and you can simply drag and drop that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.27,
          "end": 261.33,
          "en": "So download it and then drag and drop it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261.33,
          "end": 264.903,
          "en": "into your user's folder next to the add user component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.95,
          "end": 268.29,
          "en": "This file includes a couple of styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 268.29,
          "end": 271.623,
          "en": "which will help us make this look nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.61,
          "end": 276.4,
          "en": "Now to use this file, we have to go to add users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.4,
          "end": 278.37,
          "en": "to the add user component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.37,
          "end": 280.56,
          "en": "and besides importing the card here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 280.56,
          "end": 283.01,
          "en": "we can now also import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 283.01,
          "end": 285.01,
          "en": "from that newly added CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 285.01,
          "end": 287.883,
          "en": "So from the add user dot module dot CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 288.77,
          "end": 291.69,
          "en": "for non JavaScript files, you need to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 291.69,
          "end": 293.65,
          "en": "that file extension here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 293.65,
          "end": 296.71,
          "en": "And now to apply that, I wanna go to my card",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.71,
          "end": 299.90999999999997,
          "en": "and actually add the class name property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 299.90999999999997,
          "end": 302.483,
          "en": "and add classes dot input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 303.57,
          "end": 307.05,
          "en": "The input class is defined here in the CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 307.05,
          "end": 309.5,
          "en": "and with that, we can add it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.5,
          "end": 312.21,
          "en": "But now there's one important thing to note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 312.21,
          "end": 315.71,
          "en": "Of course here card is our custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 315.71,
          "end": 319.41,
          "en": "it's not one of those built in HTML components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 319.41,
          "end": 321.95,
          "en": "And therefore, since it's our own component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 321.95,
          "end": 325.88,
          "en": "it only has to props, or it only is able to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 325.88,
          "end": 330.04,
          "en": "with the props we use inside of that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 330.04,
          "end": 333.57,
          "en": "Now, these default HTML components like form, label, input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 333.57,
          "end": 336.79,
          "en": "divs, and so on, they are all pre-configured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 336.79,
          "end": 340.44,
          "en": "by React to for example work with the class named prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.44,
          "end": 342.88,
          "en": "and to then apply a fitting CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 342.88,
          "end": 346.24,
          "en": "to the underlying rendered HTML note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 346.24,
          "end": 348.96,
          "en": "Now for our own component, it of course does not know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 348.96,
          "end": 351.17,
          "en": "what to do with the class name prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 351.17,
          "end": 352.98,
          "en": "because it's just our own component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.98,
          "end": 355.14,
          "en": "not a built in HTML component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 355.14,
          "end": 358.88,
          "en": "So, we have to go to our own component and make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 358.88,
          "end": 361.62,
          "en": "that we accept incoming class named prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.62,
          "end": 364,
          "en": "and that we do something with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 364,
          "end": 365.96,
          "en": "Now, what do we want to do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 365.96,
          "end": 368.7,
          "en": "In the end, I want to make sure that the CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 368.7,
          "end": 371.54,
          "en": "we're applying to the div, with the help of class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.54,
          "end": 375.35,
          "en": "on that div, that the class is applied to the div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 375.35,
          "end": 379.1,
          "en": "reflect both the card class, which we already are applying,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 379.1,
          "end": 382.76,
          "en": "as well as any potentially incoming classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 382.76,
          "end": 386.01,
          "en": "on the class named prop of this card component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 386.01,
          "end": 389.77,
          "en": "So that any class I add here on the card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 389.77,
          "end": 392.90999999999997,
          "en": "when I use it, isn't the end applied together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 392.90999999999997,
          "end": 395.07,
          "en": "with the card class to the div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 395.07,
          "end": 397.12,
          "en": "which is rendered by the card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.12,
          "end": 399.82,
          "en": "So I wanna apply two CSS classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 399.82,
          "end": 402.72,
          "en": "One coming from the card module CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 402.72,
          "end": 405.6,
          "en": "and one coming from outside, from the props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.6,
          "end": 407.923,
          "en": "potentially coming via props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408.79,
          "end": 411.07,
          "en": "And we can easily make this work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
